# `检索.ps1` carries a UTF-8 BOM on purpose: Windows PowerShell 5.1 decodes a
# .ps1 without one using the system ANSI code page, which turns its Chinese
# command names into mojibake and makes the script unparseable. Never let a
# tool rewrite that file without the BOM.
* text=auto
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.py  text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
